{
  "methodological_boundary": "gnomAD v4.1 provides variant-level aggregate AC/AN/HOM/HEMI counts without individual-level joint genotypes. Therefore cross-variant totals represent cumulative variant-level heterozygous allele-carrier instances (Boole/Frechet upper bound on unique carriers) rather than exact deduplicated unique individuals. We additionally compute the independence-assumption Poisson-binomial prevalence estimate (1 - prod(1 - p_i)) and the single-variant Frechet lower bound (max p_i), alongside AN detection-scope strata (>=80%, >=95%, genome-only <160k) and live gnomAD v4.1 GraphQL exome-vs-genome-vs-joint decomposition.",
